{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C9B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Paz，哥斯达黎加政府把发电站建在山顶上，到底是怎么想的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这里又没有河，湖水很快就会干涸吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"普通发电站的话确实如此。不过计划中的好像是抽水蓄能电站。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"抽水蓄能电站？Kaz也提过，那到底是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就是用水泵把水抽到湖里，再让水落下来发电的设施。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"AUX_FIRST_HALF_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"等一下。这不就是没完没了地白费力气吗？我看只是在做无用功。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"JPN_SAI_NO_KAWARA_IDIOM_NATURALIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"如果抽上来马上就拿去发电，确实如此。不过抽水蓄能电站其实是一种电池。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_SPLIT_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"电池？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"比如在电力有富余的夜里先把水抽上去。白天电力不足时，再用这些水发电就行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"AUX_NIGHT_DAY_STORAGE_LOGIC_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"原来如此，因为火力发电和核电站很难调节输出功率。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"但现在的哥斯达黎加应该根本没有多余的电力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_PROJECT_CANCELLATION_MOVED_TO_NEXT_ROW_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以计划才会被取消吧。CIA那些家伙正好利用了这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"JPN_CIA_UTILIZATION_PRIMARY"}]}